{%- comment -%}
  Quadrant, 400x240: a postcard, about 144px of content height. One thing only.

  Which one thing depends on the weather. This plugin exists to carry MET's
  warnings (ADR-0001), so when a warning is issued the warning IS the screen and
  the forecast steps aside. Otherwise the screen is the current conditions.
  This is the only layout where the warning replaces the forecast rather than
  shrinking it, because it is the only one with no room to do both.

  No title bar: #9 puts the CC BY credit on the full screen and both halves,
  and leaves the quadrant to carry it in the author bio. That buys back the
  height the one thing needs.

  A failed warnings poll still shows the conditions, with the marker #19 asked
  for. Silence here would read as "no warnings" on the very screen whose job is
  to show them.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col layout--center gap--small">

  {% if forecast_ok == false and warn_count == 0 %}

    <span class="value value--small">No forecast data</span>
    <span class="label label--xsmall">MET Norway did not answer</span>

  {% elsif warn_count > 0 %}

    <div class="flex flex--row flex--center-y gap--small bg--black px--2 py--1">
      <span class="title title--small text--white text--uppercase">&#9888; {{ warn_level }}</span>
    </div>
    <span class="title title--medium text--center" data-clamp="2">{{ warn_event }}</span>
    <span class="label label--small text--center" data-clamp="1">
      {{ warn_area }}{% if warn_count > 1 %} &middot; +{{ warn_count | minus: 1 }} more{% endif %}
    </span>

  {% else %}

    <div class="flex flex--row flex--center-y gap">
      {% render "weather_icon", code: now_symbol, box: "w--[56px] h--[56px]" %}
      <span class="value value--xlarge value--tnums" data-fit-value="true">{{ now_temp | round: 0 }}&deg;</span>
    </div>
    <span class="label label--small text--center" data-clamp="1">
      {{ place | default: "Forecast" }} &middot; feels {{ now_feels | round: 0 }}&deg; &middot; {{ now_wind | round: 0 }} m/s {{ now_dir }}
    </span>
    {% if warnings_ok == false %}
      <span class="label label--xsmall label--outline">Warnings unavailable</span>
    {% endif %}

  {% endif %}

</div>
